(181, 13, 'In dynamic programming, what is the time complexity to find the optimal Matrix Chain Multiplication of n matrices?', 'O(n)', 'O(n log n)', 'O(n^2)', 'O(n^3)', 'D'),
(182, 13, 'Which of the following relational operations is NOT commutative?', 'Division', 'Natural Join', 'Union', 'Intersection', 'A'),
(183, 13, 'In a synchronous counter with 4 flip-flops, how many distinct states does it cycle through?', '8', '16', '32', '4', 'B'),
(184, 13, 'For a compiler target architecture with 3-address instructions, what is the minimum number of temporary variables required for: x = a * b + c * d - e / f ?', '1', '2', '3', '4', 'C'),
