(186, 14, 'A 2-way set associative cache has 64 sets, 32 bytes per block, and 32-bit physical address. What are the bit widths of Tag, Set, and Word offset?', 'Tag=21, Set=6, Word=5', 'Tag=20, Set=7, Word=5', 'Tag=22, Set=5, Word=5', 'Tag=19, Set=8, Word=5', 'A'),
