(188, 14, 'A relational database schedule S involves two transactions: T1: R(A), W(A); T2: R(A), W(A), R(B), W(B); T1: R(B), W(B). Is S conflict serializable?', 'Yes, equivalent to T1 -> T2', 'Yes, equivalent to T2 -> T1', 'No, it contains a conflict cycle between T1 and T2', 'Yes, view serializable only', 'C'),
